The current pearl-cannon geometry and the historical v1.7.1-v2.0.5 octagonal
orbital geometry are independently authored procedural designs covered by the
original-code license above. From v2.0.6 the generated orbital-cannon body
instead uses the community-published "Farlands orbital strikes Unstable SMP"
layout uploaded by AquaYAY (schematic metadata author: ArcticF35). Wemmbu
credits cubicmetre for the episode's cannon design; an exact schematic revision
has not been independently verified. This imported geometry retains its
respective owners' rights and is excluded from the MIT code license. The source
listing states no explicit redistribution license, and this project grants no
license over that geometry. Source hash, selected bounds and modifications are
recorded in ORBITAL_BLUEPRINT_SOURCE.json. Legacy IDs and old geometry are
retained for save compatibility and conservative migration; see CREDITS.md and
ORIGINAL_CANNON_DESIGNS.json.

The fifteen newly proposed AI-background/native-render character posters are
separate review artifacts and are not bundled in this release. Existing episode
thumbnail images remain third-party works excluded from this code license.
No license to underlying character designs, names, skins, recordings or
Minecraft assets is granted by this document.
